      "narrative": {
        "headline": "Empathy Ledger",
        "summary": "Empathy Ledger is not only a product. It is one of ACT's load-bearing stack layers: - the wiki holds the durable framing for story sovereignty, consent, and identity - Empathy Ledger holds the live story, photo, video, and editorial layer - the websites compose EL material into project pages, journals, and partner surfaces That architecture is the point, not an implementation detail. See Living Website Operating System for the full operating model and Studio Business Model for how EL strengthens ACT's public surface, media quality, and ecosystem earning power.",
